+/* Emit the VEX prefix, in place of (never in addition to) the REX prefix,
+   the mandatory-prefix byte and the 0F/0F38/0F3A escape bytes -- VEX folds
+   all four into itself, which is why asm_opcode() suppresses each of them
+   for an OPC_VEX entry.  Layout, Intel SDM Vol.2 2.3.5:
+
+       c4  |  ~R ~X ~B mmmmm  |  W vvvv L pp
+
+   R/X/B extend the same three register fields REX does and are stored
+   inverted; mmmmm names the escape map (1=0F, 2=0F38, 3=0F3A); pp names
+   the mandatory prefix (0=none, 1=66, 2=f3, 3=f2); vvvv is a fourth
+   register operand, also inverted, that has no encoding outside VEX.
+
